      "layer": "investigation", "section": "NPC 记忆碎片",
      "keywords": ["面罩", "撬棍", "接待室", "记忆"],
      "text_key": "worldbook.emilia.memory.parlor",
      "text": "回到接待室她会想起：“他们戴着面罩。有一个特别高——他把撬棍扔在门口了。”",
      "speakers": ["emilia"], "public_scene": [], "scenes": [], "topics": ["manor.room.reception"], "conditions": []
    },
    {
